  "title": "Lemon Pound Cake with Aunt Evelyn&#39;s Lemon Glaze",
  "description": "This lemon pound cake, flavored with lemon extract, has a sweet, tangy glaze made with lemon juice and zest to make the perfect dessert for lemon fans.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah Copeland Sawicki"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:58:23-04:00",
